1. Meeting Purpose

The purpose of the meeting was to discuss recent conference insights related to SOC 2 and ISO 27001, review the current state of the ISMS risk assessment and risk register, identify gaps in risk-to-control mapping, discuss AI governance considerations, and align on next steps for management review preparation.

